## 2. PlaneGCS LGPL Relinking Architecture

In compliance with the GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL v2.1/v2.0-or-later):
1. **Dynamic / Modular Boundary**: `@salusoft89/planegcs` is loaded dynamically as an isolated WebAssembly module (`planegcs.wasm`) and runtime boundary. It is not statically compiled into proprietary source closures.
2. **User Replaceability**: Users may recompile PlaneGCS from source and substitute the `planegcs.wasm` binary or npm package without rebuilding the proprietary engine application.
3. **Upstream Modifications**: Any bug fixes, performance modifications, or binding patches made directly to the PlaneGCS solver codebase shall be contributed back or made publicly available under LGPL-2.0-or-later.

