### CI Enforcement Mechanism
CI pipeline includes an automated dependency-license scanner (`license-checker` / `pip-licenses`) that parses all runtime production dependencies:
- Any package licensed under `GPL`, `GPL-2.0`, `GPL-3.0`, `AGPL-1.0`, `AGPL-3.0`, or custom non-commercial terms fails the CI build with exit code 1.
